              <lg xml:id="m-7acc24c0-8a81-49d1-8079-0154ef60ebaf">
                <l xml:id="m-07cf7318-286f-4762-8187-3238ff42bb42" facs="#m-45c6a072-bf0a-41e3-8cf4-853b71a96d82" label="text-like">The Nativity of our Lord.</l><l xml:id="m-b2dae3f9-7ce9-45f4-bb61-6ff971ac9ed2" facs="#m-ecf880ba-7299-42cc-b102-086874b9c41c" label="ambiguous">376</l><l xml:id="m-961d84b5-b8b0-483f-ae08-5f1f453c3a5c" facs="#m-dcbbeb6a-0e98-4f5b-8262-620135fe0b0f" label="lyrics-like">ru- it. V. Gló-ri-a</l><l xml:id="m-94cb215f-836e-4339-a305-1f1fcd9f12ed" facs="#m-9cb31c3a-5244-4a04-affc-1c337bbcf917" label="lyrics-like">in excélsis Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-9b7e1303-ff13-4b93-a176-78ac3be3cb6e" facs="#m-c248fbfb-cff4-4fb3-9951-50ed18b88692" label="ambiguous">o, et in</l><l xml:id="m-284fa476-1a90-4116-9504-899dc8f6fdb7" facs="#m-ff15969b-3dbb-4b05-8cf3-fabcf29f773e" label="lyrics-like">térra pax homínibus bónae vo-luntá¬</l><l xml:id="m-6ff000d2-036b-4546-b2d8-46c2bd159ba4" facs="#m-3efcd926-0f6d-44d3-9b1a-c1f0326097a3" label="lyrics-like">tis. — Gáu-det.</l><l xml:id="m-1b228ecd-4a16-4e63-b655-0841be2ff411" facs="#m-f6f255b1-23e1-4d70-8927-116791ef1b9b" label="lyrics-like">V. Gló-ri-a</l><l xml:id="m-53dc6fd0-6dcd-4e91-af22-2dec15709dd8" facs="#m-5312e235-1942-435d-94d6-8aeb32d5cd7f" label="lyrics-like">Pátri, et Fí-li¬</l><l xml:id="m-2e3dee59-d75c-47fe-bb21-e45dd9b8a600" facs="#m-8a791546-32b4-41bf-b59e-f4ef847b3aa9" label="lyrics-like">et Spi-rí¬ tu¬i</l><l xml:id="m-35359511-5711-468d-8878-fc61643197d5" facs="#m-a71de6d2-607e-4fae-80b3-7df7504a2497" label="ambiguous">o,</l><l xml:id="m-92ab723f-9bcb-4cd6-8bd5-e3ed8afc6998" facs="#m-68ac1a9f-7289-4be5-aec6-7d3a502bc54a" label="lyrics-like">Sán- cto. R. Hódi- e asfar as V.</l><l xml:id="m-ec0b6c21-e45b-413a-83ba-2b12094c54dd" facs="#m-390ee742-3e29-47d5-892e-36ce99c8f7eb" label="text-like">The Lector: Jube, domne, benedicere.</l><l xml:id="m-7ca1a905-bbd8-4d62-b7b8-a00e2628ac7b" facs="#m-4b568c60-a58c-49b7-9e6a-680d9ff836fa" label="lyrics-like">Blessing. Unigénitus Dei Filius* nos benedícere et adjuváre</l><l xml:id="m-7a849c08-594f-4b92-b236-b5a55b70f2d7" facs="#m-0b834746-76cd-44bc-bc53-bc1972258989" label="lyrics-like">dignétur. K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-b3516d39-8cfb-4a36-b088-a00104cc45e1" facs="#m-7c5ede7a-289c-4902-8061-c412524deed7" label="ambiguous">Chap. 40.</l><l xml:id="m-332bd13c-d5ee-42d2-bb93-529e0f3ab909" facs="#m-f046a6ec-eefa-45b8-8367-af0ed1d47498" label="ambiguous">Lesson II.</l><l xml:id="m-de85674b-707d-42fd-933e-bcb7297d8642" facs="#m-14641893-9aba-465f-a364-c5cb31e5b2c2" label="lyrics-like">vOnsolámini, consolámini, pópule</l><l xml:id="m-b263383b-08e9-4d1e-a795-45086aefe6a0" facs="#m-ec2f8508-6c38-4ff0-bfa1-db0f35ed980a" label="lyrics-like">bitur glória Dómini: et vidébit</l><l xml:id="m-2f6911af-2d3b-4d52-9448-50f583b5a643" facs="#m-19369e2a-5d9a-456a-aef7-d84e09d4ba82" label="lyrics-like">L meus, dicit Deus vester. Loquí¬</l><l xml:id="m-1958e46d-ddf0-4741-b8b1-1a17d6bc293d" facs="#m-53614396-66d5-40f4-8e8a-01374a7acbb2" label="lyrics-like">omnis caro páriter quod os Dómini</l><l xml:id="m-49469df1-7f6d-4bb2-b426-413dfb1fc072" facs="#m-daae3d9f-eb35-4ff6-9ed9-ab5db233b317" label="lyrics-like">locútum est. Vox dicéntis: Clama.</l><l xml:id="m-2dae8442-08e1-4df0-8c37-5ae1942eeea1" facs="#m-7be5cfd7-a78f-4746-a49c-ca5e992d0549" label="lyrics-like">mini ad cor Jerúsalem, et advocáte</l><l xml:id="m-fe9190c0-7af9-45df-a1cf-d58b3b9255ac" facs="#m-a6fd7d71-99ac-4375-afa0-f584e775a958" label="lyrics-like">eam: quóniam compléta est malí¬</l><l xml:id="m-481269c5-54aa-44f7-86af-88534c8a9750" facs="#m-264cd917-2596-4006-b01b-5e700c2ad80f" label="lyrics-like">Et dixi: Quid clamábo? Omnis</l><l xml:id="m-6a8aba2c-5248-4630-8bb5-83349de54a20" facs="#m-3b6513ee-be61-4983-ae48-d6b08af7d0fe" label="lyrics-like">tia ejus, dimíssa est iníquitas illius:</l><l xml:id="m-830ee06a-442c-471e-b5a9-e15fe392e369" facs="#m-2ac811f9-418a-4e04-9c9f-18c7fa76aee2" label="lyrics-like">caro foenum, et omnis glória ejus</l><l xml:id="m-e68faf57-aaa2-4153-8a0d-19c733f1daee" facs="#m-11e6d873-8def-4697-988b-123643baf5cf" label="lyrics-like">suscépit de manu Dómini duplicia</l><l xml:id="m-dba7812f-bff5-427d-a74c-b7676b6bf6dc" facs="#m-0c0a1d63-0cd0-4366-9a99-b4be369b090e" label="lyrics-like">quasi flos agri. Exsiccátum est foe¬</l><l xml:id="m-06d7948e-53e0-4ab9-a192-51f1fe310f9d" facs="#m-c2144243-223d-40f5-a106-f3e442e4205b" label="lyrics-like">pro ómnibus peccátis suis. Vox cla¬</l><l xml:id="m-038bc725-0024-43e8-8f0b-66d0703d1329" facs="#m-23da0fec-b41d-4a5d-8c6a-b5b9fe310576" label="lyrics-like">num, et cécidit flos: quia spíritus</l><l xml:id="m-7913cf31-b51a-4a72-ad0d-51d121e41003" facs="#m-33361ac8-9202-4124-9432-82c1e9250ff5" label="lyrics-like">mántis in desérto: Paráte viam Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-d9dbfbd4-58f2-4200-ac12-ca25668d0150" facs="#m-051227e9-7811-47e2-9e82-7911f9219eba" label="lyrics-like">Dómini sufflávit in eo. Vere foenum</l><l xml:id="m-bd0093f9-6ead-4434-b64a-dce401f8f143" facs="#m-a01f78c7-0fae-4c01-a809-c8c35e8d0936" label="lyrics-like">mini, rectas fácite in solitúdine sé¬</l><l xml:id="m-a3f418ec-8742-44ca-9af2-d713ee85cadc" facs="#m-c8e249ad-c77d-45bf-b912-1b5e94f06231" label="lyrics-like">est pópulus: exsiccátum est foenum,</l><l xml:id="m-0a84bbd5-3fc7-461f-a8a2-3f55fa5fe0f6" facs="#m-dfc25804-9889-44ad-b1ec-6578511e8738" label="ambiguous">mitas Dei nostri. Omnis vallis exal¬</l><l xml:id="m-fe32f27b-436d-4d40-bdc0-a936b500ad7b" facs="#m-791f612d-6f76-4471-a6be-de3dca7471a9" label="lyrics-like">et cécidit flos: Verbum autem Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ba703e8-e23a-4808-9ab5-26487943811d" facs="#m-c698be07-3920-4621-8d4b-e47777f09b88" label="lyrics-like">tábitur, et omnis mons et collis hu¬</l><l xml:id="m-ba4f4b5b-7769-408e-b40a-19b7d2978189" facs="#m-29244187-40a4-4272-9be5-d5083a07aa2c" label="lyrics-like">mini nostri manet in aetérnum. Tu</l><l xml:id="m-7ad4a27f-a6c2-467e-859e-e2a1ee2bbacb" facs="#m-6ff6092e-b7c3-4fae-8f81-7914daf1ec38" label="lyrics-like">miliábitur: et erunt prava in dirécta,</l><l xml:id="m-980cf3d2-9c3c-4729-acd7-e12a9791c9ee" facs="#m-73a54796-53ac-48a5-bb10-e234ffc7bb87" label="lyrics-like">autem, Dómine, miserére nobis.</l><l xml:id="m-f79a1d14-4632-47e6-9afd-c2fd072c0a09" facs="#m-4353ddfe-d72b-44e7-b855-ab866e7c2c73" label="lyrics-like">et áspera in vias planas. Et revela-l E. Déo grátias.</l><l xml:id="m-bf3b0dbb-6219-4d36-885a-5860f325f829" facs="#m-01dfec9f-8aca-4f3b-98b2-09daf9a40cba" label="ambiguous">2. Resp.4</l><l xml:id="m-503e59c1-0c08-4705-8e06-0e61007c610b" facs="#m-1d20eb73-f5d1-491d-a08a-819a6f95475f" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-9ec844c1-e4a7-4617-bf2f-ad42010fc236" facs="#m-e4c3348e-5c00-45be-aa62-d2d360d1646c" label="lyrics-like">L odi-e nóbis“ de caé¬</l><l xml:id="m-90d6d3a3-4d0a-4151-8b63-eb4db5e07463" facs="#m-e03708cc-9e31-487b-bdea-cf882c1101be" label="lyrics-like">lo pax vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-354dd8c8-5a0d-471d-bff2-8750ecac2f5e" facs="#m-26cda58f-1e66-4d84-aa17-083e5786c8ca" label="ambiguous">ra de¬</l><l xml:id="m-29f4549b-bb4a-419b-b3c3-03f9f79fe20b" facs="#m-6627bcc0-ca28-4736-ad94-d565383ba127" label="lyrics-like">scén- dit :" Hó-di¬</l><l xml:id="m-32497ae9-5844-4006-a900-76b9eb5d468f" facs="#m-75b74266-807d-444b-8edc-62d708acc0ce" label="lyrics-like">per tó- tum mún-dum mel- lí¬</l></lg>
